      "source": "Entity callback method invoked before a domain object is saved. Can return either\nthe same or a modified instance of the domain object. This method is called before\nconverting the <code>entity</code> to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, so the outcome of this\ncallback is used to create the record for the domain object.",
      "translation": "在保存域对象之前调用的实体回调方法。可以返回相同的域对象实例或修改后的实例。此方法在将 `<code>entity</code>` 转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 之前被调用，因此该回调的结果将用于创建域对象的记录。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/callback/EntityCallback.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.callback\"><code>EntityCallback</code></a> to populate auditing related fields on an entity about to be\nbound to a record.",
